1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:11,770
Jesus came to the town of Capernaum and stayed at Peter's house. Everyone heard, and they all squeezed in. People inside, people outside, people everywhere!

2
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:17,260
God loves every one of you. His kingdom is right here among you.

3
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:27,780
Just then, four good friends came down the road, carrying a man. His legs couldn't walk, so every day he had to lie on his mat.

4
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:33,390
Come on, we're nearly there! Jesus can help you, I know He can!

5
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:36,950
Thank you, friends... I'm so nervous.

6
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:41,370
Excuse me! Excuse me, please... oof!

7
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:45,800
No pushing! There's no room!

8
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,500
Hmm... we can't get in the door...

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,890
I've got it! We'll go in through the roof!

10
00:00:52,590 --> 00:01:02,430
Step by step, they carried their friend up onto the roof. In those days roofs were flat, made of wood, branches and mud.

11
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:08,180
Dig, dig, dig! Dig, dig, dig!

12
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:13,580
Hey! Hey, hey, HEY! My roof!

13
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:19,120
Ha ha! Peter, look... someone's coming.

14
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:31,320
They made a hole in the roof, and with ropes they let the mat down... slowly... slowly... right in front of Jesus.

15
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:39,680
Jesus looked up at the four friends, and He saw how much they trusted Him.

16
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,400
Son, your sins are forgiven.

17
00:01:44,330 --> 00:01:51,800
Some people grumbled inside: only God can forgive sins! Jesus knew what they were thinking.

18
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:55,480
So that you will know I have the power to forgive sins...

19
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:58,560
Get up! Pick up your mat, and go home!

20
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,590
My... my legs... I'm standing! I can walk!

21
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:11,940
Wow! We have never seen anything like this!

22
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:15,740
Everyone was amazed, and they all praised God.

23
00:02:16,140 --> 00:02:21,630
All right, all right... that hole was worth it!

24
00:02:22,630 --> 00:02:32,180
That evening, Jesus said to His friends: let's go across to the other side of the lake. So they got into Peter's boat.

25
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:43,260
Jesus had been busy all day. He was tired, so He lay down on a cushion at the back of the boat and fell asleep.

26
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:51,380
Suddenly a huge storm came! Wave after wave crashed into the boat, and it was filling up with water!

27
00:02:52,930 --> 00:02:59,910
Bail! Bail faster! It's no good, there's too much water!

28
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:07,580
Teacher! Teacher, wake up! We're going to sink! Don't you care about us?

29
00:03:09,980 --> 00:03:12,720
Wind, stop! Waves... be still!

30
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:19,630
Why were you so afraid? Do you still not trust Me?

31
00:03:20,430 --> 00:03:24,890
Who is this? Even the wind and the waves do what He says!

32
00:03:25,790 --> 00:03:36,510
A magic trick fools your eyes. But Jesus did real miracles. They show us that He loves us, and He is able to help us.

33
00:03:37,110 --> 00:03:45,460
And just like the four good friends, we can bring people who need help to Jesus too.
